:: j4 [j4 explore]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->j4: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Visit the Bloom School.->j4: bloom school]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'j4'>><<n>><<w>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'j4'>>
</div>

:: j4: bloom school
<<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('chop')>>
  <p>The school is closed?!?!</p>
  <p>A random person says that they're waiting for Zahara to return from a trip into the deep desert.</p>
  <p>Maybe you'd better follow her out there and see if you can help.</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
  </ul>
<<else>>
  (Keyword chop detected)

  You've solved the Bloom School challenge and helped to re-open the school. Zahara is greeting people as they approach the entrance, directing them inside to their classes.</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Say hello to Zahara.->j4: zahara's thanks]]
    <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
  </ul>
<</if>>